Description: A client pulls the hosted-report storage key with a finalized-header read proof and proves that the pull itself leaves the welfare XCM counters unchanged (16 §12; 15 I-36).
Network: ./zombienet/networks/bleavit-client-para.toml
Creds: config

bleavit-collator-1: reports block height is at least 10 within 300 seconds
client-collator-1: reports block height is at least 10 within 300 seconds
relay-alice: js-script ./js/open-hrmp-channels.js with "4343:4242,4242:4343" within 300 seconds
client-collator-1: js-script ./js/client-quickstart.js with "register" within 300 seconds
bleavit-collator-1: js-script ./js/client-quickstart.js with "remote-refusal" within 300 seconds
bleavit-collator-1: js-script ./js/client-report-pull.js with "pull" within 300 seconds
